; rec69 — BRASS SIMULATOR3 (type 0x7B, GUI group Vocal Effect) — the full
; (stylized) LIP + BORE WAVEGUIDE. Mono in_L, dual-mono out. Chain:
; 1. family AGC: |in<<8| env (attack c004=1/256, release c005=1/2048, state
;    PM 9800) -> drive = 0.111 + 8.35e8/env clamp 4.0 (c006-c009); env also
;    mirrored to c003.
; 2. x = in * drive * c00a (1e-8) -> the lip ODE, 2x-oversampled (LCNTR=2,
;    eps = c010 = 0.01): u' = x - v - 0.0667u^3 - 0.7u^2 (same u law as
;    rec67/68); v' = u^3 + u - v + TUBE (c00f=1.0 leak; the -x term of
;    rec67/68 is replaced by +u and the bore feedback).
; 3. THE BORE: a 512-sample I2 delay line in a Karplus-Strong-style loop:
;    line_in = 0.12*v (c014, the lip->bore injection) - 0.8 (c015) * H(z)*tap
;    where H = (1+z^-1)/2 (the c012/c013 two-tap averager = loop damping,
;    zero at Nyquist); negative feedback -> odd-mode comb (resonances at odd
;    multiples of ~43 Hz). The averaged tap ALSO feeds back into v' (via
;    c013, one frame late) — bore pressure re-exciting the lip: a coupled
;    physical model.
; 4. output pick = the v' RHS (u^3 + u - v + tube) -> +6 dB Nyquist shelf
;    (unity DC; pole c016=.751, c017/c018) -> x c019 (0.001) -> cubic clip
;    x - x^3/3 rails +-2/3 (c01a-c01c) -> x c01d (4e9) x c01e (Q31) >>8,
;    CLIP 24-bit.
; Full doc: dsp/final-batch-algorithms.md §2.
pm:0x8400  Brass3_entry           ; I0 = I1
pm:0x8401  Brass3_lineBase        ; R14 = I2; MODIFY(I2,0x3FF): park at P+1023, walk down
pm:0x8403  Brass3_readIn          ; R8 = in_L; <<8
pm:0x8405  Brass3_env             ; family envelope: atk 1/256, rel 1/2048 (state PM 9800)
pm:0x840c  Brass3_agcRecip        ; drive = 0.111 + 8.35e8/env (RECIPS seed)
pm:0x8410  Brass3_agcClamp        ; env <= 0.1 -> drive = c009 = 4.0
pm:0x8412  Brass3_normalize       ; F15 = float(in<<8) * c00a (1e-8) * drive — ODE input
pm:0x8417  Brass3_odeLoop         ; LCNTR=2: 2x-oversampled Euler (eps 0.01)
pm:0x8419  Brass3_odeU            ; u' = x - v - 0.0667u^3 - 0.7u^2
pm:0x841e  Brass3_odeV            ; v' = u^3 + u - v + tube(c013) — bore-coupled variant
pm:0x8428  Brass3_loopWrap        ; MODIFY(I0,-6)/(+6)
pm:0x842a  Brass3_tubeRead        ; M7=-512: bore tap (512 smp = 11.6 ms; odd-mode comb ~43 Hz)
pm:0x842d  Brass3_tubeAvg         ; 0.5*tap + prev(c012) = (1+z^-1)/2 loop damping
pm:0x842f  Brass3_tubeCells       ; c012 <- 0.5*tap; c013 <- averaged tap (feeds v' next sample)
pm:0x8433  Brass3_tubeMix         ; line_in = 0.12*v (c014) - 0.8 (c015) * averaged tap
pm:0x8436  Brass3_tubeWrite       ; DM(I2,M3): write bore line at P+511
pm:0x8437  Brass3_outPick         ; R10 = F7 = v' RHS
pm:0x8438  Brass3_shelf           ; +6 dB Nyquist shelf, unity DC (c016-c018, state PM 9801)
pm:0x843d  Brass3_preclip         ; x c019 (0.001)
pm:0x8441  Brass3_clipTest        ; cubic clip guards (+-1.0)
pm:0x8445  Brass3_cubic           ; y = x - x^3/3
pm:0x844a  Brass3_railPos         ; +2/3
pm:0x844c  Brass3_railNeg         ; -2/3
pm:0x844d  Brass3_outScale        ; x c01d (4e9) x c01e (Q31) >>8
pm:0x8453  Brass3_clipOut         ; CLIP +-0x7FFFFF
pm:0x8454  Brass3_outL            ; dual-mono out
pm:0x8455  Brass3_outR
pm:0x8456  Brass3_return          ; I2 = R14; RTS (DB); MODIFY(I8,0x4E) (2 state words)
dm:0xc003  brass3_env_mirror      ; envelope copy (runtime)
dm:0xc004  brass3_env_atk         ; 0x00800000 = 1/256
dm:0xc005  brass3_env_rel         ; 0x00100000 = 1/2048
dm:0xc006  brass3_agc_base        ; 0.111
dm:0xc007  brass3_agc_num         ; 8.35e8
dm:0xc008  brass3_agc_thr         ; 0.1 (Q31)
dm:0xc009  brass3_agc_clamp       ; 4.0
dm:0xc00a  brass3_norm            ; 1.0e-8
dm:0xc00b  brass3_ode_u           ; ODE state u (runtime)
dm:0xc00c  brass3_ode_a           ; 0.0667
dm:0xc00d  brass3_ode_b           ; 0.70
dm:0xc00e  brass3_ode_v           ; ODE state v (runtime)
dm:0xc00f  brass3_ode_leak        ; 1.0 — v leak (variant: -v, not -2v)
dm:0xc010  brass3_ode_eps         ; 0.01 — Euler step (x2 iterations)
dm:0xc012  brass3_tube_half       ; 0.5*tap[n-1] (runtime — averager memory)
dm:0xc013  brass3_tube_out        ; averaged bore tap -> v' feedback (runtime)
dm:0xc014  brass3_tube_inject     ; 0.12 — lip(v) -> bore injection gain
dm:0xc015  brass3_tube_fb         ; 0.80 — bore loop feedback (negative -> odd modes)
dm:0xc016  brass3_shelf_p         ; 0.7507 — unity-DC +6 dB Nyquist shelf
dm:0xc017  brass3_shelf_q1        ; -1.6220
dm:0xc018  brass3_shelf_q0        ; 1.8712
dm:0xc019  brass3_preclip         ; 0.001
dm:0xc01a  brass3_clip_hi         ; +1.0
dm:0xc01b  brass3_clip_lo         ; -1.0
dm:0xc01c  brass3_third           ; 1/3
dm:0xc01d  brass3_renorm          ; 4.0e9
dm:0xc01e  brass3_level           ; Q31 ~1.0
